{"id":"n39532-1-8","stage":5,"title":"내뱉다 · 吐","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n39532-1-8-1","ko":"지금 먹은 것은 맛이 이상해요.","zh":"我现在吃的这个味道有点奇怪。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"먹은","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹은","audio":"/audio/1d859792bc976ecdc401.mp3"}},{"text":"것은","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것은","audio":"/audio/66faf3bab33879865298.mp3"}},{"text":"맛이","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛이","audio":"/audio/967e9ccf650ca1244186.mp3"}},{"text":"이상해요.","meaning":"奇怪，古怪","explanation":"이상하다：奇怪，古怪；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"이상하다","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71167","senseId":"2","lemma":"이상하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상해요","audio":"/audio/4895194da0b1e770fe70.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"9639f89